{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……那之后。", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪过了好一会才终于能自由行动……", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那边还有滴下来的！给我全部擦干净！不准留下任何痕迹！”", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7476", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“居然在社团教室里爱爱了，绝对、绝对不可以被发现！”", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7477", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道……！”", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比起清理自己的身体，我们更拼命打扫社团教室。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为刚才的性爱实在太激烈，各种液体飞散得到处都是。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且纱凪说的对，我们绝对不能让社团的大家发现这件事。", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪、纱凪！你的胯下有东西滴下来了！滴在地板上！”", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……根本扫不干净嘛！新吾射太多了，你到底射了多少啊！”", "text_idx": 155, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7478", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，就是‘全部’而已……”", "text_idx": 147, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说我到底榨了多少啊！我到底多喜欢新吾啦～～～～～～～～！”", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7479", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……喜欢到没有极限？”", "text_idx": 132, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……嗯。”", "text_idx": 152, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7480", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈哈。”", "text_idx": 149, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸嘿、嘿嘿嘿……”", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7481", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“现在不是聊天的时候了！总之打扫！先打扫再说！”", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7482", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“社团教室让我扫就行了，纱凪那个，嗯，先清理好自己比较好……”", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……的确。那我们都先冷静下来穿好制服吧。”", "text_idx": 140, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7483", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说的也是，不能一直裸体……”", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是我们清理身体，穿上制服。", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼……纱凪……”", "text_idx": 148, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾，你应该没有偷看我擦身体穿制服，然后又变大吧？”", "text_idx": 139, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7484", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有！我没有看！而且我今天已经全部射光了！”", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可是新吾你真的很喜欢我，感觉好像又会复活……可能性……”", "text_idx": 145, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7485", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 129, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“居然有！？居然有喔！？你到底，到底！”", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7486", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我无法坚定的说没有可能，的确是没有极限……”", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好、好吧……如果那样就再一次……”", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7487", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“结果我也是啊！一样嘛！我们根本就是一对没有极限的情侣嘛！”", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7488", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好像会让性爱和打扫永远重复下去。”", "text_idx": 136, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“到早上吧……然后被美羽学姐发现……”", "text_idx": 144, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7489", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪全身都虚软无力的状态。”", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾则是对着那样的我又变大了。”", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7490", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……努力打扫吧。”", "text_idx": 131, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……也对……”", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7491", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“毕竟新吾变大的时候是只属于我的……”", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7492", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？问题是那个吗！？”", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算是美羽学姐我也不会让她看的！”", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7493", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你的心意我很高兴，但现在先放一边吧！冷静一点纱凪，冷静！”", "text_idx": 143, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谁能冷静啊！那边我已经擦过了，结果新吾的精液又从肚子里流出来！”", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7494", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道了、我知道了啦！总之冷静下来，来，纱凪──”", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……虽然花了很多时间，但我们总算把社团教室打扫干净，离开了学校。", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉……要是结果因为气味被发现的话就太悲惨了。”", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7495", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“已经开窗换气过了，我想应该没问题……”", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好吧，反正能做的都做了，应该没事。”", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7496", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算真的被发现，嘻嘻嘻，新吾也会负责任嘛。”", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7497", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我会努力。”", "text_idx": 137, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂，不是那样吧！你这时应该说‘一起负责吧’才对啦！”", "text_idx": 158, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7498", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪从旁边撞我。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后就这样把脸颊贴在我的手臂上。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不可能被发现的啦。毕竟那间社团教室总是有各种味道。”", "text_idx": 130, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7499", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么说也对。”", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉～难得的亲亲热热的余韵，居然没办法两个人好好享受……”", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7500", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“毕竟是那种场所……今后找事后可以安心放松的场所吧。”", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔、嗯……但是、那个、呃、比起那个……”", "text_idx": 153, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7501", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯嗯。”", "text_idx": 134, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7502", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "红扑扑的脸蛋撒娇地蹭了蹭。", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后抬起眼眸看我。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……嗯，说的也对。今天的份现在来做吧……一点点也好……”", "text_idx": 154, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7503", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我抱住她。", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪闭上眼睛，抬起头。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟刚才的眼神一样，我立刻就理解了意思。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯、啾……嗯……”", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7504", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嘴唇轻轻地碰触她。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……纱凪可爱地颤抖起来。", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿嘿……光是这样，‘喜欢’就在全身扩散的感觉……”", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7505", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为还留有余韵吗……”", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7506", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我吻了你，但你还能站着喔。”", "text_idx": 138, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……真的耶！没有像以前那样腿软！”", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7507", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么呢……啊，根本不必想吧。”", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7508", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？抱歉，为什么？”", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾不懂吗？”", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7509", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不好意思……”", "text_idx": 141, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈……那本小姐纱凪就教教你吧。”", "text_idx": 157, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7510", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯♪”", "text_idx": 133, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7511", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪扑到我怀里，我正以为她要主动吻我……", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然是因为……身体已经学会更厉害的事情了呀……♪”", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7512", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 129, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“懂了吗？”", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7513", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……噗，啊哈哈，说的也是……嗯！”", "text_idx": 135, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀！？喂、喂！不要突然把我抱起来……！”", "text_idx": 146, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7514", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我可不想被突然就亲我的纱凪这样说啊。”", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 210, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“照你这样说那新吾不是更──噗，啊哈哈！没完没了呢……啊哈哈哈……”", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 216, "voice": "sn7515", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──２月１４日，情人节。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "年明け２月１４日（日）_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对我们来说值得纪念的日子又增加了。", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
